<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2497_9629.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freünt: nachbarlich willig dienst, und
<lb n="2"/>waß wir liebs und guots vermoegend, zuvor,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frome</unclear>, Fürsichtige, Eersame und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weiße</unclear>, In-
<lb n="4"/>sonders liebe guote Freünd, und nachbarn.
<lb n="5"/>Auf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestriges</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tags</unclear> an uns abgangnen
<lb n="6"/>schreiben, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinen</unclear> ihr begert <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuowüßen</unclear>, ob wir
<lb n="7"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">scheinig</unclear> die <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costantzer</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oertlin</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einzunemmen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außzugeben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbotten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> in
<lb n="9"/>antwort freündt: nachbarlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvernemen</unclear>.
<lb n="10"/>daß wir uns wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerinnern</unclear> sonderbarer
<lb n="11"/>ordnungen, die wir mit den benachbarten
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberkeiten</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">müntzen</unclear> halben gemacht, und
<lb n="13"/>wüssen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderst</unclear> nit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> daß wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darbij</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>der zeit verbliben, ob gleichwol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tagen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">was</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihro</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Frl</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gnaden</unclear> der <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Praelat</unclear> von Sant Gallen</persName>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rueff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">od</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbiettung</unclear> ein Conferentz tag, deßwegen an uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnet</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dißer</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-7" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Costantzischen</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhoffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> derselbig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werkh</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerichtet</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oerlin</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">scheinig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ist</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sach</unclear> werden sein solte, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnmassen</unclear> dann wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bißhero</unclear>
